<https://drift-king.org/ah/site/var/approval-release-results> a p-plan:Variable ; rdfs:label "what a release approval's checks found" .
<https://drift-king.org/ah/site/var/approval-packages> a p-plan:Variable ; rdfs:label "the packages a release approval names, and what they bring" .

<https://drift-king.org/ah/site/var/approval-wanted> a p-plan:Variable ; rdfs:label "what a release approval's document wanted, and what went" .

# The quotes in the model are the signed words: each is compared with the signed file
